{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minerva Labyrinth\u00a0</strong>is a turn-based, party-based, first-person dungeon crawler set in the near future of\u00a0Earth.\u00a0 Take command of five warriors with incredible powers and defend humanity from an ancient enemy known as the Hate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hate is Forever</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 1990s, humanity finally comes together on an unprecedented\u00a0scale to confront the\u00a0 global climate and energy crises that threaten its future.\u00a0 Over fifty years later, civilization thrives worldwide in a new era of cooperation and humanism, and the recent rediscovery of ancient magic promises miraculous new advancements.\u00a0 Yet as human strife recedes, something dark and forgotten returns from deep in the earth...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minerva Squad</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own party from twelve classes, fourteen passive skills, and customizable stats, or jump in right away with the balanced quick-start party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone in your fight.\u00a0 Return to your allies to recover from your wounds and upgrade your equipment, from bows and swords to skirts and tiaras.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Labyrinth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer 16 fully hand-crafted dungeon levels, spanning multiple locations and biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The labyrinth itself is your enemy, but beyond traps, riddles, mazes, and grisly monsters lie valuable hidden treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the Hate in fast-paced interleaved turn-based combat.  Each enemy type has its own powers and tactics to counter your own, and each labyrinth has a powerful overlord waiting to crush you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-annotated automap tracks your progress as you explore the labyrinth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO out now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes the optional prologue in the subway, plus two levels of the first dungeon, and allows character progression up to level 4.\u00a0 Your progress in the demo will carry over to the full game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Smoke and Shadow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/ccfba8d6faf1bb3328c38dc56102e7133345fce0.jpg"},{"name":"Death and Decay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/ccfba8d6faf1bb3328c38dc56102e7133345fce0.jpg"},{"name":"Fire and Steel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/ccfba8d6faf1bb3328c38dc56102e7133345fce0.jpg"},{"name":"Blood and Bone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/ccfba8d6faf1bb3328c38dc56102e7133345fce0.jpg"},{"name":"The Setting Sun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/837f120e21491f5dca7215efb0e4e4264348911e.jpg"},{"name":"Observant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/3f75f6f9918b800adcd2b451f2c4415ef2cf970c.jpg"},{"name":"Strength Training","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/3f75f6f9918b800adcd2b451f2c4415ef2cf970c.jpg"},{"name":"Cardinal's Legacy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/3f75f6f9918b800adcd2b451f2c4415ef2cf970c.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Delve","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/3f75f6f9918b800adcd2b451f2c4415ef2cf970c.jpg"},{"name":"Goddess' Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520970/3f75f6f9918b800adcd2b451f2c4415ef2cf970c.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s